* ''1.1.0'' -- 2026.08.17 -- Localised the licence and version history: `licence.tid` and `history.tid` are now language selectors that block-transclude `language/<lang>/licence` and `language/<lang>/history`, falling back to en-GB — same montage as `readme.tid`. The licence body itself stays in English in every language: only the original text of a licence is legally binding, so only its framing is translated (introduction, headings, //Third-Party Components// prose).
